усиливает наречие **касно**.\\n5. Глагол **вратио** — прошедшее время (перфект) мужского рода единственного числа от **вратити** (совершенный вид). Соответствует русскому «вернулся».\\n\\n===CARD===\\n{\"kind\": \"text\", \"combinations\": [{\"label\": \"се вратити\", \"surface\": \"се ... вратио\", \"why\": \"возвратный глагол «вернуться», частица se стоит во 2-й позиции\"}, {\"label\": \"кући\", \"surface\": \"кући\", \"why\": \"датив/локтив кућа со значением направления «домой»\"}, {\"label\": \"синоћ\", \"surface\": \"синоћ\", \"why\": \"наречие «вчера вечером»\"}, {\"label\": \"веома касно\", \"surface\": \"веома касно\", \"why\": \"устойчивое сочетание «очень поздно»\"}]}'}"}],"links":[],"hidden":false,"retry":false,"extra":{"severity":"normal","retries":[],"categories":[],"history":{"statistic":{"failed":0,"broken":0,"skipped":0,"passed":6,"unknown":0,"total":6},"items":[{"uid":"f0f5abdaca0ad136","reportUrl":"https://andgineer.github.io/echo-words/builds/tests/153/index.html#testresult/f0f5abdaca0ad136","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795675917930,"stop":1795675917935,"duration":5}},{"uid":"b6cdacaf4b4fa7d1","reportUrl":"https://andgineer.github.io/echo-words/builds/tests/152/index.html#testresult/b6cdacaf4b4fa7d1","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794033099661,"stop":1794033099664,"duration":3}},{"uid":"8b0ea23a34da18c2","reportUrl":"https://andgineer.github.io/echo-words/builds/tests/151/index.html#testresult/8b0ea23a34da18c2","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794032605653,"stop":1794032605657,"duration":4}},{"uid":"21104942687a44e9","reportUrl":"https://andgineer.github.io/echo-words/builds/tests/150/index.html#testresult/21104942687a44e9","status":"passed","time":{"start":1793720057921,"stop":1793720057927,"duration":6}},{"uid":"6401fbfc0106d4eb","reportUrl":"https://andgineer.github.io/echo-words/builds/tests/149/index.html#testresult/6401fbfc0106d4eb","status":"passed","time":{"start":1793719295730,"stop":1793719295736,"duration":6}}]},"tags":[]},"